4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"price_lock\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"freeze\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ad_pause\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notify\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rectify_window_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">24</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DP-004\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"severity == 'medium' OR rule_class == 'statistical'\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"actions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"notify\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"rectify_window_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">168</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"never_auto_apply\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"force_repricing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"no_auto_action_when\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rule_class == 'collusion'\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rule_class == 'gouging_lead'\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"escalate_on\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"unactioned_hours\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">72</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"repeat_within_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三条约束是这份配置的红线。<code>never_auto_apply</code> 把强制改价从自动路径里彻底移除。<code>no_auto_action_when</code> 让串通与哄抬线索绕过全部自动动作——它们在法律上需要证据链，平台无权自行认定。<code>rule_class == &#39;statistical&#39;</code> 落到只通知，因为统计判据的输出是「值得看的候选」而不是事实认定。</p>\n<h3 id=\"策略与动作的分离让灰度可行\">策略与动作的分离让灰度可行</h3><p>策略版本化带来的一个实际收益是<strong>处置强度可以灰度</strong>：新规则上线时先只通知不冻结，观测两周误报率后再开启冻结。这个灰度不需要改代码，只需要发布一版新策略并把 <code>rule_class</code> 映射到更保守的动作集。没有这层分离，任何规则上线都只能用全强度处置，而全强度处置在初期几乎必然伴随大量误处置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>判定结果与处置动作之间必须有一层可版本化的处置策略；同一严重度在不同市场、商家等级与规则类别下动作不同。</li>\n<li>强制改价是唯一直接改写业务数据的动作，只允许用于定义性错误，绝不用于统计型判据。</li>\n<li>冻结（阻断交易）与下架（阻断曝光）是两个独立动作；「只下架不冻结」是危险的半开状态，不应作为默认组合。</li>\n<li>处置必须是显式状态机，<code>partial</code> 是必须存在的中间态，语义是「有动作已生效、有动作未生效」。</li>\n<li>每个动作都要幂等，靠动作语义（置状态而非切状态）与唯一约束实现，而不是靠调用方小心。</li>\n<li>跨系统处置没有原子性，目标应是<strong>可收敛性</strong>：任何中间态都要可检测、可推到终态。</li>\n<li>补偿不是回滚而是语义抵偿（广告暂停与已发通知无法等价撤销），文案设计必须按「通知不可撤回」来写。</li>\n<li>恢复必须使用处置前像而非重算，并在恢复前检查目标是否被第三方修改过；<code>drifted</code> 时转人工。</li>\n<li>串通与哄抬类线索禁止任何自动动作，只走法务复核。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>处置生效之后，商家的沟通、整改期限与复核闭环见 <a href=\"merchant-rectify-notify\">商家整改通知与复核</a>；处置被误执行时的申诉路径与白名单机制见 <a href=\"../price-patrol-governance/false-positive-appeal\">误判申诉与白名单</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"价格冻结/下架处置","id":"价格冻结-下架处置"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"冻结与下架不是一回事","id":"冻结与下架不是一回事"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么必须有显式状态机","id":"为什么必须有显式状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"处置状态机与数据模型","id":"处置状态机与数据模型"},{"level":3,"text":"状态定义","id":"状态定义"},{"level":3,"text":"表结构","id":"表结构"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等与重复处置","id":"幂等与重复处置"},{"level":2,"text":"动作的依赖、顺序与补偿","id":"动作的依赖-顺序与补偿"},{"level":3,"text":"顺序不能靠调用顺序保证","id":"顺序不能靠调用顺序保证"},{"level":3,"text":"全有或全无的幻觉","id":"全有或全无的幻觉"},{"level":2,"text":"误处置与恢复","id":"误处置与恢复"},{"level":3,"text":"恢复的三种触发","id":"恢复的三种触发"},{"level":3,"text":"恢复必须用前像而不是重算","id":"恢复必须用前像而不是重算"},{"level":3,"text":"误处置的成本要能被度量","id":"误处置的成本要能被度量"},{"level":2,"text":"处置策略的可配置形态","id":"处置策略的可配置形态"},{"level":3,"text":"策略是一份可版本化的数据","id":"策略是一份可版本化的数据"},{"level":3,"text":"策略与动作的分离让灰度可行","id":"策略与动作的分离让灰度可行"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"批量价格巡检任务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-price-compliance-patrol/patrol-task-enforce/price-patrol-batch-job"},"next":{"title":"商家整改通知与复核","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/product-price-compliance-patrol/patrol-task-enforce/merchant-rectify-notify"}}